WEBVTT

00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:02.820
<i>Please, Sakura-senpai.</i>

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:05.430
<i>Don't let this game be as far as we get.</i>

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:06.150
Ball!

00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:08.860
<i>Let's try to paint the black.</i>

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:14.450
Ball!

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:16.530
Ball!

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:19.580
Ball!

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:21.540
Ball four!

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:27.420
Huh?

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:31.260
Seriously?!

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:33.860
That's a crazy long lead!

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:37.550
Wow. They're really messing with us.

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:40.510
<i>He told me not to attempt any pickoffs...</i>

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:44.690
<i>But if we get an out from it...
it'd be silly not to, right?!</i>

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:46.450
Safe!

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:48.400
He ain't out?

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:53.740
Ball.

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:55.710
Ball!

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:58.080
Ball!

00:00:58.640 --> 00:00:59.920
Ball four!

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:03.600
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:05.330
<i>We're already in a tight spot.</i>

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:08.870
<i>Don't fall to pieces, Senpai!</i>

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:12.300
<i>Ya gotta know ya can't just
worry 'bout 'em stealin'!</i>

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:15.910
Ball!

00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:17.430
Ball four!

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:22.590
Anita!

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:25.760
Let's step out and take a—

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:26.780
Play!

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:27.510
Time—

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:29.230
Oh boy.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>I need to throw a strike...</i>

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:41.030
Go!

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:46.160
What?!

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:47.250
For real?!

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:55.000
Safe!

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:56.550
Second!

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.260
I don't think so!

00:01:58.760 --> 00:01:59.760
All right! He's cornered!

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:04.010
Back home!

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:10.360
Safe!

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:16.330
What the hell was that play earlier?!

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:19.820
You totally underestimated 
my throw back to home!

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:24.290
And what's more, half of
Sakura-senpai's walks were your fault!

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:26.620
You got her to paint the
corners from the first ball,

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:29.500
before she had time to find her groove.

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:33.210
Everyone could see the batters
were watching her pitches,

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:36.190
so you should've got her to
throw strikes and cornered 'em.

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:37.900
How stupid are you?!

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:42.270
You made life seriously
tough for your pitcher.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:19.570
<b>No Freakin' Way!</b>

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:21.030
<i>Batting fourth, catcher, Kabashima-san.</i>

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:21.030
<b>Seiwa</b>

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:21.030
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:21.030
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:22.570
Play!

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:27.450
<i>I'm gonna redeem myself with the bat
an' make up for givin' away runs.</i>

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:33.370
<i>Their 3-hole got a read on
Urabe's curveball after one swing.</i>

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:38.340
<i>We might have two outs, but don't go
underestimating their cleanup, Urabe.</i>

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:47.950
Nice swing!

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:49.180
You can do it!

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:50.470
You can hit that pitch!

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:53.080
Oh, that reminds me, Chisato.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:54.020
Huh?

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:56.480
Back when you guys joined,

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:59.730
didn't Anita say she was the cleanup hitter

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:02.070
and starting catcher for Yokohama Little?

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:04.030
Right.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:06.990
But that's not true, is it?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:12.670
Ball!

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:17.770
Well, maybe not <i>completely</i> true,
but it's not untrue, either.

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:21.090
She wore the number five,
and was our starting catcher in games.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:24.550
That is, up until the spring
tournament in sixth grade.

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.130
<i>I hafta do somethin'.</i>

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:32.060
<i>I've been entrusted with
cleanup duties for this team.</i>

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:35.430
<i>It ain't like back then,
when I wasn't even given a chance to bat!</i>

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:41.860
N-Number 12? I thought I was gonna be number 2.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:46.070
For the summer tournament,
Ishizaka will wear the mask.

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:51.990
You must've noticed how much
he's improved recently.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:58.720
But you're our backup catcher and pinch hitter,
so I still need you game-ready.

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:06.940
But that... That ain't fair!

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:09.800
Strike!

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:17.770
At the final tournament, Anita's spot was
taken by her rival from the same grade.

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:21.760
When she joined the team,
she towered over the boys,

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:23.980
with power and speed to match,

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:28.370
but by sixth grade,
the boys had caught up with her.

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:31.780
Her last year at Little was spent on the bench,

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:34.830
and she didn't get the chance
to showcase her skills.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:38.170
She was pretty down about it.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:43.740
Huh?

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:45.880
Baseball at Fuurin Middle?

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:50.410
Yeah! Our seniors, Sawa-san
and Sagara-san, are there too.

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:52.850
Plus, I heard they're short
on players right now.

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:55.970
So let's go to Fuurin Middle together.

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:58.810
I'm done with baseball.

00:06:59.140 --> 00:06:59.860
Huh?

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:03.160
It's a boys' sport.

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:06.800
Don't matter how hard a girl tries,
she's always gonna lose out to a boy.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:08.240
Total waste o' time.

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:13.740
I'm gonna play some other sport.
One where they separate girls and boys.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.380
I don't believe you, Anita!

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.200
You're done with baseball?

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:29.590
You're quitting baseball just 
because a guy beat you one time?

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.380
One time?!

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:34.290
S'easy for <i>you</i> to say, Chisato!

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:36.870
<i>You</i> were a starter right to the end!

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:37.950
But in my case—

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:40.510
I want to keep playing baseball!

00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:43.480
I want to play baseball with you again!

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:46.700
Chisato...

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:52.720
It's not like you to blame losing
your spot on being a girl.

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:57.030
Give it another shot, together with me!

00:07:58.890 --> 00:07:59.910
<i>Shackled.</i>

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:01.160
<i>I jammed her good!</i>

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:06.530
Let's challenge ourselves at Fuurin.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:09.150
We'll take it to the boys
and see how far we get!

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:17.020
Run, Anita!

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:24.980
She just did that.

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.480
No way.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:32.300
All right!

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:34.360
We caught up!

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:38.620
Nice one!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:39.160
Yay!

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:41.620
Nice home run!

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:43.160
Yeah!

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:47.580
Dammit.

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:49.620
That was unexpected.

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:53.050
You'd jammed her, but it still
flew all the way to the stands.

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:56.670
I must've underestimated them
on some level 'cause they're girls.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:57.780
Damn.

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:59.510
I won't let them score again!

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:04.750
We're aiming for the Regionals.
We can't afford to stumble here.

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:07.060
Draw a line under it, man.

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:08.770
Sakura's up next.

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.650
Keep your cool and be careful.

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:13.880
Yeah, yeah, I <i>know</i>.

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:21.900
Strike three!

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:23.000
You're out!

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.460
<b>Seiwa</b>

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.460
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.460
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:26.430
All right! Tied game, tied game!

00:09:26.430 --> 00:09:28.740
Let's really focus and keep this tight!

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:30.420
Yeah!

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:32.600
Senpai?

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:34.450
What is it?

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:38.700
Y'all sure ya want me
to keep wearin' the mask?

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:43.650
I might mess up again like last inning.

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:48.100
When ya said I was bein' tested, ain't that
the sorta thing ya were worried 'bout?

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:51.780
My coach back at Little tol' me somethin'...

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:55.900
But that... That ain't fair!

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:58.110
<i>S'obvious</i> I'm a zillion
times better'n him!

00:09:58.110 --> 00:10:00.590
Why'm I bein' made to sit on the bench?!

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:02.580
Please explain yer decision!

00:10:03.230 --> 00:10:05.610
I didn't want to have to say this,

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.500
but I'll give it to you straight.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:12.540
Someone with your personality
will never make a good catcher.

00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:20.510
He tol' me I'd struggle if I didn't
become an alert, attentive shot-caller

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.200
with good situational awareness.

00:10:22.690 --> 00:10:24.600
I got hella mad at the time,

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:27.690
but looks like Coach called it right.

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:28.980
So that's why...

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:30.990
I understand.

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:32.980
We can discuss it some other time.

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:37.120
But for now, you'll have to see this game out.

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:42.200
Truth is, I hurt my shoulder 
a while back, so I can't take over.

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:43.330
What?!

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:47.780
<i>Bottom of the second.
Seiwa Middle to bat.</i>

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:50.950
<i>Batting sixth, left field, Hirai-kun.</i>

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:51.790
Play!

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:53.130
<i>Seriously?</i>

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:59.800
<i>So I'm... the only catcher on the team right now?</i>

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:04.140
Third!

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:10.480
Out!

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:12.190
Nice one, third!

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:17.610
<i>Batting seventh, right field, Terahara-kun.</i>

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:29.910
Mine!

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:33.630
Safe!

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:37.340
Damn, even their lower order is fast.

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:38.400
All right!

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:40.260
Let's pay 'em back for what they did!

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:41.800
Keep us rolling!

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.390
I'm sorry.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:46.260
I prob'ly oughta left that one to you.

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:50.400
Jeez, how long are you going to keep moping?

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:54.070
I'm more than happy pitching to you

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:57.610
and Daigo can't take your place,
so you'll just have to get on with it.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:12:00.170
A catcher needs to be able
to shake it off and go again.

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:01.150
Believe in yourself!

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:07.120
<i>Batting eighth, shortstop, Saito-kun.</i>

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:08.510
Play!

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:13.490
<i>She's right.</i>

00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:16.590
<i>Why'm I gettin' myself so worked up
when I'm a total idiot?</i>

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:20.050
<i>We've figured out her tells.
We've seen enough to know their game.</i>

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:23.990
<i>Go!</i>

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:25.680
He's running!

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:29.060
All right!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:30.600
A perfect steal.

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:33.500
<i>Ya can't jus' change yer personality.</i>

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:35.600
<i>If ya make errors,
ya just hafta correct 'em!</i>

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:41.360
<i>Right now, I'm the one who
has to be Fuurin's pivot!</i>

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:48.330
Out!

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:49.580
What?!

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:51.380
Bullseye.

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:52.800
Wow. Got him.

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:57.900
<i>Jus' ya try to run! See how far ya get!</i>

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:06.890
<b>Seiwa</b>

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:06.890
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:06.890
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:13:18.050 --> 00:13:19.120
Safe!

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:23.940
<i>Batting fourth, catcher, Suzuki-kun.</i>

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:29.830
<i>You're telling me not to run?</i>

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:31.740
<i>It's the top of the third.</i>

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:33.400
<i>We're tied at 2-2.</i>

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:34.720
<i>Two outs and I'm on first.</i>

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:36.330
<i>Andy, our cleanup, is at bat!</i>

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:40.480
<i>Did that failed steal
before spook you, Coach?</i>

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.880
<i>We whittle the other team down
with our speed. It's how we play.</i>

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:49.260
<i>It's not like you to go all cautious 
just 'cause we messed up a steal.</i>

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:52.680
Ball!

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:56.390
<i>Let me run on the next one, Coach.</i>

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:57.900
<i>Huh?</i>

00:13:57.900 --> 00:13:58.780
Out!

00:13:58.780 --> 00:13:59.640
Three outs!

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:00.310
Change sides!

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:03.230
All right!

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:07.370
<i>Damn.</i>

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:08.840
<i>They got me.</i>

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:12.620
<i>'Cause Andy's left-handed, she was in
my blind spot and I let my guard down.</i>

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:16.580
<i>I didn't think she'd try
a pickoff while crouching!</i>

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:18.780
You idiot!

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:21.850
I bet you were thinking about
why I didn't sign for you to steal!

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:23.800
A-As if I'd do that...

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:25.950
Anita, nice one!

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:31.590
'Bout yer pitchin' jus' now...
I think we oughta go even higher.

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:34.000
And get them used to that, yeah? Gotcha.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.810
I think we should hit them
with some waste pitches, too.

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:39.810
I'll rethink our pitchin' variations.

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:43.900
<b>Seiwa</b>

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:43.900
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:43.900
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:44.270
<b>Seiwa</b>

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:44.270
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:44.270
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:45.780
<b>Seiwa</b>

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:45.780
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:45.780
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:47.600
<i>Bottom of the third.</i>

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:49.740
<i>Fuurin Middle School to bat.</i>

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:52.910
<i>Batting ninth, left field, Shigeno-kun.</i>

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:58.870
Strike!

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:02.330
<i>They feel even faster when
you're in the batter's box.</i>

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:06.510
Strike!

00:15:07.930 --> 00:15:09.040
Strike three!

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:10.180
You're out!

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:16.290
<i>I won't let you off so easily next time.</i>

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:27.940
<i>Man, yer annoyin'.</i>

00:16:27.940 --> 00:16:30.650
<i>Ya plan on foulin' every
awkward pitch we throw at ya?</i>

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:33.720
<i>If that's how ya wanna play,
let's show ya a high fastball.</i>

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:40.350
Ball!

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:43.280
<i>Next up, a low slider to the inside!</i>

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:49.730
Center!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:52.600
All righty!

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:53.780
One out!

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:04.360
Strike three!

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:05.710
You're out!

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:13.630
<b>Seiwa</b>

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:13.630
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:13.630
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:17:29.180 --> 00:17:30.150
Strike three!

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:31.650
You're out!

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:32.260
<i>Yes!</i>

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:35.110
<i>No way am I gonna let you find your groove.</i>

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:39.570
<b>Seiwa</b>

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:39.570
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:39.570
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:38.000
<i>Top of the sixth.</i>

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:40.330
<i>Seiwa Middle to bat.</i>

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:43.890
<i>Batting first, second base, Moriguchi-kun.</i>

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:45.550
<i>Just two innings left...</i>

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:47.910
<i>Both teams are back to the top of the order.</i>

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:52.500
<i>The top and bottom of the
sixth will be pivotal in this game.</i>

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:55.720
Let's clean this up!

00:17:55.950 --> 00:18:00.510
I seriously didn't think Sakura's mob would
make us dig this deep so late in the game.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:03.930
Go, Moriguchi!
Let's do it this inning!

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:08.270
Right!

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:18.270
All right! Extra bases!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:21.730
Oh no. This is really bad.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:23.660
To third! To third!

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:32.860
Run for home, Moriguchi!

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:34.050
Anita!

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:35.380
Y-Ya gotta be kiddin'!

00:18:38.070 --> 00:18:39.800
Kabashima!

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:41.270
There ain't no time!

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:42.510
I'll do it myself!

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:57.190
S-Safe! Safe!

00:18:57.510 --> 00:19:00.160
Yeah! We took the lead!

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:03.110
I'm so sorry.

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:05.580
If I hadn't dropped the ball...

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:08.120
Nah, I fumbled it jus' like you did.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:11.070
Well, that's down to how that guy slides.

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:14.540
He doesn't slow down at all,
so the glove can easily get knocked away.

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:16.250
Don't worry about it!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:19.720
Yeah, they're only one run ahead.
The game's still wide open.

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:26.800
<i>Batting second, center field, Miyata-kun.</i>

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:28.480
Keep us rolling, Miyata!

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:33.440
<i>They've started figuring me out
the third time down the order.</i>

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:37.070
<i>If I let up now,
they'll hit it long again!</i>

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:40.960
Ball!

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:51.920
Ah, my bad!

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:55.510
<i>What the heck?</i>

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:57.220
<i>My wrist feels funny.</i>

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:01.090
<i>Did I hurt it in that close play earlier?</i>

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:08.140
All right!

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:10.020
You got it!

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:12.100
Nice batting!

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:16.310
<i>I can see back-to-back pitching
is catching up with Mutsuko.</i>

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:20.270
<i>Batting third, pitcher, Urabe-kun.</i>

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:23.110
All right, go for broke, Urabe!

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:29.740
<i>Judging from Urabe-kun's pitching,
we can't afford to let them get any more runs.</i>

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:33.410
<i>I need to stop him!</i>

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:42.510
Anita!

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:45.550
Second!

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:54.690
What the hell are you doing?!

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:00.110
<i>All right! Runners on first and third!</i>

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.570
Close call.

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:05.280
Anita?

00:21:09.780 --> 00:21:10.900
Anita!

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:13.620
Timeout! Timeout!

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:15.650
It hurts.

00:21:15.650 --> 00:21:16.870
You hurt your wrist?

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:18.660
Y-Yeah...

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:21.090
I'm sorry it happened now, 
of all times...

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:27.010
If she's hurt bad, you won't be able to continue.

00:21:27.850 --> 00:21:31.040
You only have nine players,
which means you have no substitutes,

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:35.980
and if you can't field another catcher,
you've got no choice but to forfeit the game.

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:36.830
Do you understand?

00:21:37.450 --> 00:21:39.740
F-Forfeit the game?!

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:41.520
Stop bein' silly!

00:21:41.520 --> 00:21:44.650
See? I'm fine! Totally fine!

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:46.400
So let's jus' resume the game!

00:21:46.730 --> 00:21:47.830
Ouch!

00:21:49.260 --> 00:21:50.530
You can't play.

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:52.830
I'll go talk to your coach.

00:21:54.860 --> 00:21:56.290
No!

00:21:56.290 --> 00:22:00.000
There's no freakin' way 
we're losin' like this!

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:02.320
Umpire!

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:10.380
In that case, I'll switch
from left field to catcher.

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:16.430
If she moves into the outfield,
can we finish the game without forfeiting?

00:22:19.660 --> 00:22:20.910
You?

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:21.860
Yes.

00:22:23.380 --> 00:22:26.100
I will be the catcher.

00:24:00.380 --> 00:24:02.500
Shigeno-senpai's playin' catcher now?

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:04.790
Was that stuff 'bout his shoulder all lies?

00:24:04.790 --> 00:24:06.380
Wonder what his shot-callin's like...

00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:08.300
Who gives a rat's ass?!

00:24:08.300 --> 00:24:10.630
Just let me pitch already!

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:13.450
Sakura-senpai's gettin' doggone tired, too.

00:24:13.450 --> 00:24:15.090
How's he gonna turn this around?

00:24:15.090 --> 00:24:16.180
I can't wait to find out.

00:24:16.180 --> 00:24:18.220
I'm telling you, put me on the mound!

00:24:18.220 --> 00:24:20.020
Hey! Don't ignore me!

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:22.130
Next time: "That Old Daigo Magic?"

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>That Old Daigo Magic?</b>

00:24:22.130 --> 00:24:24.330
Run to the stage of your dreams!
